\u001b[39mThe\u001b[7Gtests\u001b[13Gshow\u001b[18Gthat\u001b[23G\u001b[38;5;105mdiv_cents()\u001b[35G\u001b[39mneeds\u001b[41Gto\u001b[44Ground\u001b[50Ghalf\u001b[55Gup\u001b[58Ginstead\u001b[66Gof\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Gtruncating. I'll fix it using standard integer\u001b[50Grounding logic:\u001b[66G\u001b[K\u001b[30;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
